// The Feldip hunting grounds, mapsquares 39_45, 40_45 and 41_45, imported from the rev 474 cache by
// tools/models/import474map.py. 377 has no terrain there at all - the strip was added with Hunter in
// November 2006 - so these are the locs 474 places on it that the 377 content did not already have.
//
// Ops were edited after import. A loc op with no handler is a dead click, so:
//   - the dead tree and the jungle tree are ordinary trees (category=tree, normal_tree_table);
//   - the boulder's Set-trap is live: deadfalls (scripts/hunter_traps.rs2, 2026-09-23);
//   - the pit's Trap is live: pitfalls (scripts/hunter_traps.rs2, 2026-09-23);
//   - Inspect on the jungle plants and burrows and the bush's Search/Attack are live: Feldip weasel
//     tracking (scripts/hunter_tracking.rs2, 2026-09-23). The plants and burrows carry
//     category=hunter_track_node, so one trigger serves all seventeen of them;
//   - the cave's Enter and the young vine's Climb lead nowhere in this build yet.

